@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-02 - Search/Filter Products

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Product UI" as FE
control "ShoesController / ReviewsController" as API
control "ShoesService / ReviewsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoes, shoesDetail, reviews" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-02
FE -> API: GET /shoes?category=&color=&price=
API -> Service: Execute Search/Filter Products
Service -> DB: Read/write shoes, shoesDetail, reviews
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Danh sách sản phẩm được lọc

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Không có kết quả -> hiển thị empty state
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang ở trang product listing
Post: Danh sách sản phẩm được lọc
Main flow:
1. User chọn filter: category, color, price range, size
2. System gọi API GET\n/shoes?category=men&color=Black&minPrice=50&maxPrice=150
3. System trả về filtered results
4. User có thể nhập text search vào thanh tìm kiếm
5. System gọi API GET /shoes?search=Air+Max
end note
@enduml
